We are looking for an Associate to work in our banking and finance team, with banking and finance experience focused on cross-border financing.
You will have the opportunity to build a successful career in an achievement orientated yet supportive environment. You will be working in one of the most established full-service banking and finance teams in the biggest law firm in Hong Kong (by lawyer headcount), and will enjoy the challenge of handling matters independently, seeking guidance when required. This environment offers a unique combination of diverse types of work in the banking and finance sector and resources for you to develop your speciality.
The role will focus on transactional work comprising syndicated and bilateral lending, acquisition financing and PRC-related financings, principally acting for lenders and arrangers. Solid experience in these areas, excellent deal management and communication skills, and the ability to provide commercially astute advice are required to support clients' needs in this role.
